    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that's a really solid breakdown of the scientific side. i feel like i have enough to write a really strong section on why they advocate for it. \n\ncan u do the same for the civil liberties side? i want to make sure i'm not being unfair. could u give me the same level of depth—the actual legal theories or philosophical frameworks they use to make their case? i don't want to just make it sound like they're just \"against\" stuff, i want to show the actual weight of their argument.",
